in pane, sale et aqua* decernimus jejunare.»</P> <P COM="1316">14. Fresones rex <NOTE N="1082" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1315" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1315"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">add. 1b.</HI></NOTE>  navali exercitu* adiens* ab
