 <NOTE N="1094" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1317" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1317"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">ita 2, quibus tamen in 1. locus haud sufficiebat,</HI> 
ab a. s.  <HI REND="ITALIC">desunt</HI>  2.</NOTE>  ab abbacia suimet a Taginone* episcopo*
