enodabo.</P> <P COM="1319">17. Est urbs quaedam in pago Riedirierum <NOTE N="1110" TYPE="Variae Lectiones" ANCHORED=Y COM="1319" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1319"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">ita 1b.</HI>  riedirerum 1 <HI REND="ITALIC">a.</HI>  Rederivi 2.</NOTE>   <NOTE N="(699)" TYPE="Notae" ANCHORED=Y COM="1319" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="1319D"></COL> De hoc pago, qui maximam partem, orientalem
